DESCRIPTION:1. Wind down (10 min) - Lights low\, warm shower or herbal tea
 \, no caffeine or big meals now.\n2. Prep for tomorrow (10 min) - Clothes 
 out\, lunch packed\, bag by the door\, top 3 written.\n3. 10-minute tidy (
 10 min) - Kitchen reset\, one room pick-up. Stop at the timer.\n4. Screens
  off (5 min) - Devices off and charging outside the bedroom if you can.\n5
 . Read\, stretch or journal + sleep (10 min) - Paper book\, gentle stretch
 \, or 3 lines of journal. Lights out.\n\nDefault start: 9:00 PM. Move it t
 o any time that suits you: open the event\, tap Edit\, change the start ti
 me\, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPhone) or 'This and following 
 events' (Google). Not medical advice. Check with your doctor before starti
 ng a new exercise routine. CelestialPrintCanada
